ENERGY BANDWIDTH: [-1.0986, -0.6931] = width 0.405465 = log(3/2)
  log(3/2) = 0.405465 nats = 0.584963 bits
  3/2 = reciprocal of 2/3 = the modular group generator ratio

RIEMANN SURFACE DISTANCES (from log(2) to log(root)):
   alpha     root    |2-r|     Riem      amp
       1  -1.0000   3.0000   3.2172   1.0724
       2  -0.5000   2.5000   3.4339   1.3735
       4  -0.2500   2.2500   3.7675   1.6744
